      },
      "message": "build: Docker builds for the shipped Linux target (and documented cross/native rules)\n\ndocker/linux.Dockerfile rebuilds the release linux job's tar.gz, deb, rpm\nand AppImage in a container: ubuntu:22.04 pinned by digest, the job's apt\nlist verbatim, the same cargo build line, package-linux.sh and\npackage-appimage.sh with the same pinned linuxdeploy SHA-256, and the\njob's package-content checks. docker/windows-gnu.Dockerfile cross-builds\nan unofficial x86_64-pc-windows-gnu portable zip with mingw-w64.\ndocker/README.md states per shipped target whether it builds in Docker and\nwhy snap, Flatpak, the msvc Windows zip + installer and macOS stay on\ntheir runners. No workflow added (local tooling, no Actions minutes).\n\nFixes #30\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
